---
import BaseLayout from "../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
---
<BaseLayout title="ANE Radio | Petty Rich Bey" description="ANE Radio — independent music, original shows, live conversations, comedy, and artist discovery from Petty Rich Bey.">
<section class="relative overflow-hidden px-6 py-20 md:px-8 md:py-28">
<div class="absolute inset-0 bg-[radial-gradient(circle_at_top,rgba(124,58,237,.22),transparent_55%)]"></div>
<div class="relative mx-auto max-w-6xl">
<div class="mx-auto max-w-4xl text-center">
<p class="uppercase tracking-[0.45em] text-yellow-400">Bey Mirror Media Presents</p>
<h1 class="logo mt-5 text-5xl md:text-7xl">ANE Radio</h1>
<div class="mx-auto mt-7 inline-flex rounded-full border border-yellow-400/40 bg-yellow-400/10 px-5 py-2 text-sm font-bold uppercase tracking-[0.3em] text-yellow-300">Coming Soon</div>
<p class="mx-auto mt-8 max-w-3xl text-lg leading-8 text-zinc-300">Independent music. Original shows. Real conversations. Comedy. Artist discovery. ANE Radio is coming to PettyRichBey.com.</p>
<p class="mt-4 text-zinc-500">Built for artists, hosts, listeners, and sponsors.</p>
</div>
<div class="mt-16 grid gap-6 md:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-3">
<a href="#listen" class="rounded-3xl border border-zinc-800 bg-zinc-900/80 p-7 transition hover:-translate-y-1 hover:border-purple-500"><div class="text-3xl">🎧</div><h2 class="logo mt-4 text-2xl">Listen Live</h2><p class="mt-3 text-zinc-400">A dedicated ANE Radio player is coming soon.</p></a>
<a href="#music" class="rounded-3xl border border-zinc-800 bg-zinc-900/80 p-7 transition hover:-translate-y-1 hover:border-purple-500"><div class="text-3xl">🎵</div><h2 class="logo mt-4 text-2xl">Submit Your Music</h2><p class="mt-3 text-zinc-400">Submit one song for consideration.</p></a>
<a href="#host" class="rounded-3xl border border-zinc-800 bg-zinc-900/80 p-7 transition hover:-translate-y-1 hover:border-purple-500"><div class="text-3xl">🎙️</div><h2 class="logo mt-4 text-2xl">$25 Host Your Own Show</h2><p class="mt-3 text-zinc-400">Apply for a weekly three-hour programming slot.</p></a>
<a href="#rotation" class="rounded-3xl border border-zinc-800 bg-zinc-900/80 p-7 transition hover:-translate-y-1 hover:border-purple-500"><div class="text-3xl">💵</div><h2 class="logo mt-4 text-2xl">$10 Artist Rotation</h2><p class="mt-3 text-zinc-400">Approved artists can request continued rotation.</p></a>
<a href="#requests" class="rounded-3xl border border-zinc-800 bg-zinc-900/80 p-7 transition hover:-translate-y-1 hover:border-purple-500"><div class="text-3xl">📻</div><h2 class="logo mt-4 text-2xl">Song Requests</h2><p class="mt-3 text-zinc-400">Send a request to the ANE Radio team.</p></a>
<a href="#guests" class="rounded-3xl border border-zinc-800 bg-zinc-900/80 p-7 transition hover:-translate-y-1 hover:border-purple-500"><div class="text-3xl">🎤</div><h2 class="logo mt-4 text-2xl">Request a Guest Spot</h2><p class="mt-3 text-zinc-400">Pitch yourself or a guest for an ANE Radio conversation.</p></a>
<a href="#sponsors" class="rounded-3xl border border-zinc-800 bg-zinc-900/80 p-7 transition hover:-translate-y-1 hover:border-purple-500"><div class="text-3xl">🤝</div><h2 class="logo mt-4 text-2xl">Sponsors</h2><p class="mt-3 text-zinc-400">Put your brand in front of the ANE Radio audience.</p></a>
</div>
<div id="listen" class="mt-20 rounded-3xl border border-yellow-400/20 bg-zinc-900 p-8 text-center md:p-12"><p class="uppercase tracking-[0.35em] text-yellow-400">Listen Live</p><h2 class="logo mt-4 text-4xl">ANE Radio Is Loading...</h2><p class="mx-auto mt-5 max-w-2xl leading-8 text-zinc-400">The live player and station schedule will be added when ANE Radio officially launches.</p><span class="mt-7 inline-flex rounded-xl border border-zinc-700 px-6 py-3 font-semibold text-zinc-400">Coming Soon</span></div>
<div id="schedule" class="mt-20 rounded-3xl border border-zinc-800 bg-zinc-900 p-8 md:p-10">
<p class="uppercase tracking-[0.35em] text-yellow-400">Weekly Programming</p>
<h2 class="logo mt-4 text-4xl md:text-5xl">Petty Rich Bey on ANE Radio</h2>
<p class="mt-5 max-w-3xl leading-8 text-zinc-400">These are the protected programming blocks reserved for Petty Rich Bey. All other days and times are available for approved ANE Radio hosts, specialty programming, interviews, music blocks, and special events.</p>
<div class="mt-8 grid gap-4 md:grid-cols-2">
<div class="rounded-2xl border border-zinc-800 bg-zinc-950 p-6"><p class="text-yellow-400">TUESDAY • 5 PM–8 PM</p><h3 class="logo mt-2 text-2xl">Waiting to Exhale Tuesdays</h3><p class="mt-3 text-zinc-400">Relationship-escape anthems, R&amp;B, breakup records, and “Not Gon' Cry” energy. Includes the listener advice segment <strong class="text-zinc-200">Dear Nes</strong>.</p></div>
<div class="rounded-2xl border border-zinc-800 bg-zinc-950 p-6"><p class="text-yellow-400">THURSDAY • 10 PM–1 AM</p><h3 class="logo mt-2 text-2xl">Whispers After Dark</h3><p class="mt-3 text-zinc-400">Late-night R&amp;B, dark and atmospheric sounds, slow jams, and after-hours records.</p></div>
<div class="rounded-2xl border border-zinc-800 bg-zinc-950 p-6"><p class="text-yellow-400">FRIDAY • 4 PM–7 PM</p><h3 class="logo mt-2 text-2xl">Mix-A-Lot Fridays</h3><p class="mt-3 text-zinc-400">DJ mixes, club bangers, old-school Friday-night records, “I Just Got Paid” vibes, and Chicago House.</p></div>
<div class="rounded-2xl border border-zinc-800 bg-zinc-950 p-6"><p class="text-yellow-400">SUNDAY • 2 PM–6 PM</p><h3 class="logo mt-2 text-2xl">Serenity Sundays</h3><p class="mt-3 text-zinc-400">70s and 80s dusties, soul classics, nostalgic grooves, and records like Rose Royce’s “Love Don't Live Here Anymore.”</p></div>
</div>
<div class="rounded-2xl border border-zinc-800 bg-zinc-950 p-6"><p class="text-yellow-400">EVERY OTHER SATURDAY • 2 PM–4 PM</p><h3 class="logo mt-2 text-2xl">We Love Remy Ma</h3><p class="mt-3 text-zinc-400">A special biweekly segment celebrating Remy Ma’s music, discussing the We Love Remy Ma community, and catching up on what's happening in the world of Reminisce Mackie.</p></div>\n<div class="mt-8 rounded-2xl border border-purple-500/30 bg-purple-950/20 p-6 text-center"><p class="font-semibold text-zinc-200">Open Programming</p><p class="mt-2 text-zinc-400">Tuesday, Thursday, Friday, and Sunday blocks outside the times above — plus Monday, Wednesday, and Saturday blocks outside the protected Saturday segment — may be requested by approved hosts. The We Love Remy Ma segment airs every other Saturday.</p></div>
</div>\n<div class="mt-20 grid gap-8 lg:grid-cols-2">
<div id="music" class="rounded-3xl border border-zinc-800 bg-zinc-900 p-8"><p class="uppercase tracking-[0.35em] text-yellow-400">Artists</p><h2 class="logo mt-4 text-4xl">Submit Your Music</h2><p class="mt-5 leading-7 text-zinc-400">Submit one song for consideration. Approved artists receive an initial free play opportunity. Continued rotation is available for $10/month.</p>
<form action="https://formsubmit.co/contact@pettyrichbey.com" method="POST" enctype="multipart/form-data" class="mt-8 space-y-5"><input type="hidden" name="_subject" value="ANE RADIO — MUSIC SUBMISSION" /><input type="hidden" name="_captcha" value="false" /><input type="hidden" name="_template" value="table" /><input type="hidden" name="_next" value="https://pettyrichbey.com/ane-radio?submitted=music" /><input name="artist_name" required placeholder="Artist / Group Name" class="form-input" /><input name="email" type="email" required placeholder="Email Address" class="form-input" /><input name="song_title" required placeholder="Song Title" class="form-input" /><input name="genre" placeholder="Genre" class="form-input" /><input name="song_link" type="url" placeholder="Song link" class="form-input" /><textarea name="artist_message" rows="5" placeholder="Tell us about the artist or song..." class="form-input resize-none"></textarea><label class="block text-sm text-zinc-400">Optional song file<input name="attachment" type="file" accept="audio/*" class="mt-2 block w-full text-sm text-zinc-400" /></label><button class="w-full rounded-xl bg-purple-700 px-6 py-4 font-semibold text-white transition hover:bg-purple-600">Submit Music →</button></form></div>
<div id="host" class="rounded-3xl border border-zinc-800 bg-zinc-900 p-8"><p class="uppercase tracking-[0.35em] text-yellow-400">Independent Hosts</p><h2 class="logo mt-4 text-4xl">$25 Host Your Own Show</h2><p class="mt-5 leading-7 text-zinc-400">Apply for your own three-hour weekly show during available ANE Radio programming hours. Show concepts and time slots are subject to approval and availability.</p>
<form action="https://formsubmit.co/contact@pettyrichbey.com" method="POST" class="mt-8 space-y-5"><input type="hidden" name="_subject" value="ANE RADIO — HOST APPLICATION" /><input type="hidden" name="_captcha" value="false" /><input type="hidden" name="_template" value="table" /><input type="hidden" name="_next" value="https://pettyrichbey.com/ane-radio?submitted=host" /><input name="host_name" required placeholder="Your Name" class="form-input" /><input name="email" type="email" required placeholder="Email Address" class="form-input" /><input name="show_name" required placeholder="Proposed Show Name" class="form-input" /><input name="topic" placeholder="Genre / Topic" class="form-input" /><input name="preferred_day" placeholder="Preferred Day" class="form-input" /><input name="preferred_time" placeholder="Preferred 3-hour Time Slot" class="form-input" /><input name="backup_time" placeholder="Backup Day / Time" class="form-input" /><input name="social_links" placeholder="Social Media / Website" class="form-input" /><textarea name="show_description" rows="5" required placeholder="Describe your show..." class="form-input resize-none"></textarea><button class="w-full rounded-xl bg-purple-700 px-6 py-4 font-semibold text-white transition hover:bg-purple-600">Apply to Host →</button></form></div>
</div>
<div id="rotation" class="mt-8 rounded-3xl border border-purple-500/30 bg-purple-950/20 p-8 md:p-10"><p class="uppercase tracking-[0.35em] text-yellow-400">Artist Rotation</p><h2 class="logo mt-4 text-4xl">$10/month Continued Rotation</h2><p class="mt-4 max-w-3xl leading-8 text-zinc-300">After a song is accepted for ANE Radio, artists can request continued rotation for $10/month. Rotation remains subject to station programming, content standards, and available airtime.</p><a href="#music" class="mt-7 inline-flex rounded-xl border border-yellow-400 px-6 py-3 font-semibold text-yellow-300 transition hover:bg-yellow-400 hover:text-zinc-950">Submit Your Music</a></div>
<div id="guests" class="mt-8 rounded-3xl border border-purple-500/30 bg-purple-950/20 p-8 md:p-10">
<p class="uppercase tracking-[0.35em] text-yellow-400">Guests &amp; Interviews</p>
<h2 class="logo mt-4 text-4xl">Request a Guest Spot</h2>
<p class="mt-5 max-w-3xl leading-8 text-zinc-300">Want to join ANE Radio for an interview, artist spotlight, author conversation, business feature, community discussion, or special appearance? Tell us who you are and what you'd like to talk about.</p>
<form action="https://formsubmit.co/contact@pettyrichbey.com" method="POST" class="mt-8 grid gap-5 md:grid-cols-2">
<input type="hidden" name="_subject" value="ANE RADIO — GUEST REQUEST" /><input type="hidden" name="_captcha" value="false" /><input type="hidden" name="_template" value="table" /><input type="hidden" name="_next" value="https://pettyrichbey.com/ane-radio?submitted=guest" />
<input name="guest_name" required placeholder="Name / Guest Name" class="form-input" /><input name="email" type="email" required placeholder="Email Address" class="form-input" /><input name="organization" placeholder="Business / Organization / Brand" class="form-input" /><input name="social_links" placeholder="Social Media / Website" class="form-input" /><input name="guest_type" placeholder="Artist, Author, Business, Community, etc." class="form-input" /><input name="preferred_time" placeholder="Preferred Day / Time" class="form-input" /><textarea name="topic" rows="5" required placeholder="What would you like to discuss?" class="form-input resize-none md:col-span-2"></textarea><button class="rounded-xl bg-purple-700 px-6 py-4 font-semibold text-white transition hover:bg-purple-600 md:col-span-2">Request a Guest Spot →</button>
</form></div>\n<div id="requests" class="mt-8 rounded-3xl border border-zinc-800 bg-zinc-900 p-8 md:p-10"><p class="uppercase tracking-[0.35em] text-yellow-400">Listeners</p><h2 class="logo mt-4 text-4xl">Request a Song</h2><form action="https://formsubmit.co/contact@pettyrichbey.com" method="POST" class="mt-8 grid gap-5 md:grid-cols-2"><input type="hidden" name="_subject" value="ANE RADIO — SONG REQUEST" /><input type="hidden" name="_captcha" value="false" /><input type="hidden" name="_template" value="table" /><input type="hidden" name="_next" value="https://pettyrichbey.com/ane-radio?submitted=request" /><input name="listener_name" required placeholder="Your Name" class="form-input" /><input name="email" type="email" required placeholder="Email Address" class="form-input" /><input name="song_title" required placeholder="Song Title" class="form-input" /><input name="artist" required placeholder="Artist" class="form-input" /><textarea name="message" rows="4" placeholder="Anything you'd like us to know?" class="form-input resize-none md:col-span-2"></textarea><button class="rounded-xl bg-purple-700 px-6 py-4 font-semibold text-white transition hover:bg-purple-600 md:col-span-2">Send Request →</button></form></div>
<div id="sponsors" class="mt-8 rounded-3xl border border-yellow-400/20 bg-zinc-900 p-8 text-center md:p-10"><p class="uppercase tracking-[0.35em] text-yellow-400">Brand Partners</p><h2 class="logo mt-4 text-4xl">Sponsor ANE Radio</h2><p class="mx-auto mt-5 max-w-2xl leading-8 text-zinc-400">Sponsors can be featured across ANE Radio, individual shows, live programming, the website, and the wider Bey Mirror Media ecosystem. Sponsorship opportunities are coming soon.</p><a href="/sponsors" class="mt-7 inline-flex rounded-xl border border-zinc-700 px-6 py-3 font-semibold text-zinc-200 transition hover:border-yellow-400 hover:text-yellow-400">Explore Sponsorships →</a></div>
<div class="mt-16 text-center"><p class="text-sm uppercase tracking-[0.4em] text-yellow-400">ANE Radio</p><p class="mt-4 text-zinc-500">Absolutely No Excuses • Music • Shows • Conversations • Comedy</p></div>
</div></section>
<style>.form-input{width:100%;border-radius:.75rem;border:1px solid rgb(63 63 70);background:rgb(9 9 11);padding:1rem 1.25rem;color:rgb(228 228 231);outline:none;transition:border-color .2s,box-shadow .2s}.form-input:focus{border-color:rgb(250 204 21);box-shadow:0 0 0 3px rgb(250 204 21 / .08)}</style>
</BaseLayout>